code> and <code>q</code>, in a binary tree. The LCA is defined as the <stro=
ng>lowest node that has both <code>p</code> and <code>q</code> as descendan=
ts</strong>. A node can be considered an ancestor of itself.</p><h4 id=3D"e=
xample">Example:</h4><figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;just=
